{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/385354-werewolf-the-forsaken-dark-era-the-bowery-dogs-and-more","id":385354,"title":"Werewolf the Forsaken: Dark Era - The Bowery Dogs and more?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-01-29T11:47:39-08:00","id":385354,"title":"Werewolf the Forsaken: Dark Era - The Bowery Dogs and more?","content":"<a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/world-of-darkness-dark-eras-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\">The World of Darkness Dark Eras Kickstarter has begun.</a> As of this post it is halfway through being fully funded.<br /> <br /> Werewolf: the Forsaken \u2014 The Bowery Dogs (1969-1979): New York City in the 1970s. Crime. Drugs. Gang violence. Vast economic disparity. And Werewolves. It's a lean, ugly time to be alive, and the lone wolf doesn't stand a chance out there. In the end, all you really have is family. David A Hill, Jr writer &amp; Travis Stout developer.<br /> <br /> You can see the text of the book via a link on the page or <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7FqViticwNuQ0ZZLTNDNTN5cG8/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">here.</a><br /> <br /> The polls for stretch goals, which allow for a vote between two choices of new dark eras to be added to the book can also be found <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/dark-eras-poll/\" target=\"_blank\">here.</a> Lets hope we get some more Werewolf eras.<br /> <br /> In the meantime, what are your thoughts about the Bowery Dogs setting?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T12:02:45-08:00","id":385430,"title":"","content":"I've only read a paragraph but so far i'm enjoying what im seeing. course it just happened to be about cocaine and how addicts tend to get possessed easily...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T14:03:54-08:00","id":385529,"title":"","content":"I love grimmy New York. Anytime I can mix werewolves and spirit possession into &quot;The Warriors&quot; it's a good game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/785-full-time-gm","name":"Full Time GM","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar785_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T19:12:18-08:00","id":385711,"title":"","content":"And not only can people vote on the stretch goals after donating, but they actually asked for suggestions for new dark eras, so if you want more werewolf love (or whatever gameline) you can definitely vote with your wallet here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T20:16:43-08:00","id":385764,"title":"","content":"I'm slightly concerned we will get out voted by the vamps and mages out there. &gt;.&gt; Also not sure if I want to or can sign up for this kickstarter. Still hurting financially from college and the perks aren't as mouth watering as the book o the wyrm ones. Maybe that story teller screen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T20:53:46-08:00","id":385790,"title":"","content":"Dude, if you don't have money by the end of the run, let me know, I'll cover you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T21:38:01-08:00","id":385827,"title":"","content":"Lol no it's good. Once I get my tax return (yay college kick backs!!! Paying out of pocket nets bonuses) I should be good. I'll also get a PDF version of the pure so I don't have to lug that around. I want to be labeled as a werewolf supporter in the back but that 85$ tier is calling my name...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T23:18:53-08:00","id":385918,"title":"","content":"Out of books I like:<br /> <br /> 1. Hunter (sucker for Hunter) <br /> <br /> 2. Demon. <br /> <br /> 3. Mummy (For a game about history and memory, this might as well be a Mummy book). <br /> <br /> 4. Promethean,<br /> <br /> 5. Mage<br /> <br /> 6. Vampire<br /> <br /> 7. Werewolf.<br /> <br /> 8.Giest<br /> <br /> Games that Need these timelines:<br /> <br /> 1. Mummy (game of history)<br /> <br /> 2. Giest (The game line needs books, enough said)<br /> <br /> 3. Promethean (Every game needs a like Promethean)<br /> <br /> 4. Vampire (History is needed but not really needed as much as other games)<br /> <br /> 5. Werewolf (Ditto)<br /> <br /> 6. Demon (Again, Not really needed but alright)<br /> <br /> 7. Mage (Ditto)<br /> <br /> 8.Hunter (Hunter can really fit into any timeline no problem as is).<br /> <br /> Books that are simply going to win:<br /> <br /> 1.Changeling<br /> <br /> 2. Vampire<br /> <br /> 3. Mage<br /> <br /> 4. Werewolf/Demon/<br /> <br /> 5.Demon/Werewolf<br /> <br /> 6.Mummy/Hunter<br /> <br /> 7.Hunter/Mummy<br /> <br /> 8.Giest<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-30T04:22:57-08:00","id":386138,"title":"","content":"Well, I've put my pitches in. They're all Werewolf <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-30T05:01:20-08:00","id":386174,"title":"","content":"I've thought about it and while I like the Bowery Dogs, I find it kind of confining. The Shadow side of things is fleshed out nicely and the new spirits. The mechanics on drugs are going to be very helpful. The setting is good, or at least the unique themes to it, the pressure and decay, but you're mostly forced into the role of underprivileged do-gooder, which seems more like Apocalypse than Forsaken. There's an option to not play them, but it warns that it may be jarring, and the suggestions are in the vein of 'you lose your status' or 'help people without your status.' There's also a lot of the ambiguity, which I had hoped we had gotten past by now, but a spirit court disappears mysteriously, there's nothing specific in the way of the supernatural outside of spirits. Overall it's good, but could be better, I think. Most of my issues are personal quibbles, I'm sure.<br /> <br /> Anyways, Acrozatarim, can you share a pitch, or is that not allowed? I don't see them on the comments section. Please tell me it's not 1960s America <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.<br /> <br /> @Lyrics at War, I know where you're coming from, democracy can suck if you're not in the majority, but there's a lot of talk about werewolf in the comments section, some were hoping for a mash-up of Forsaken in Rome to go along with Vampire in Rome. As for the cost, that sucks, though the $5 for a single splat is a nice offer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-30T05:17:27-08:00","id":386180,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/385354-werewolf-the-forsaken-dark-era-the-bowery-dogs-and-more?p=386174#post386174\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Anyways, Acrozatarim, can you share a pitch, or is that not allowed? I don't see them on the comments section. Please tell me it's not 1960s America <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've literally only just submitted them so I'll hold off from talking about anything for the time being.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-31T13:45:17-08:00","id":387600,"title":"","content":"That said, no, not 1960's America. My pitches have been for places and periods in the 9th, 11th, and 18th centuries, as well as one that goes into the DOES NOT COMPUTE category <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-31T13:49:10-08:00","id":387603,"title":"","content":"Cool. I see a lot of people in the comments section wanting something older than 100 years, and I can appreciate that. We're almost at that first stretch goal so I'm looking forward to seeing if your pitches have been picked up. Good luck.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 01-31-2015, 04:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-31T14:48:09-08:00","id":387633,"title":"","content":"Ah, Chris, you are one of my favorite people right now. Now bother them so we can get the DOES NOT COMPUTE entry!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-31T14:58:11-08:00","id":387656,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Acrozatarim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/385354-werewolf-the-forsaken-dark-era-the-bowery-dogs-and-more?p=386138#post386138\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, I've put my pitches in. They're all Werewolf <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Hey, if you need or want a hand writing any of those... *nudge nudge* <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> (Not that I've seen them yet, but like that's ever stopped me before!)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/552-strider1276","name":"strider1276","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar552_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"382"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-31T22:51:48-08:00","id":388027,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Acrozatarim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/385354-werewolf-the-forsaken-dark-era-the-bowery-dogs-and-more?p=387600#post387600\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That said, no, not 1960's America. My pitches have been for places and periods in the 9th, 11th, and 18th centuries, as well as one that goes into the DOES NOT COMPUTE category <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Vikings, Crusades, Beast of G\u00e9vaudan and really, really, really way back in time!! Hell Yeah!! ;D<br /> <br /> I'm kidding, but these are my guesses. Just so you know, I would die for a Viking era, and this DOES NOT COMPUTE would be the best thing ever, if it's remotely like what I imagine. If it's something like Ur, or even wierder then that, something that hints of a different, more complex real origin of what really are werewolves... man, I don't know. Hope there are more awesome stuff coming for this fucking great gameline. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/196-max-deltree","name":"Max Deltree","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar196_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby"