ntent":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>strider1276</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/385354-werewolf-the-forsaken-dark-era-the-bowery-dogs-and-more?p=388938#post388938\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm not sure that the voters' geographic location matters, but hey, maybe it does! Any little bit helps!<br /> <br /> (Or, since it's Super Bowl Sunday*, for those who follow the sport, you may be familiar with the phrase from a commercial: &quot;It's only weird if it doesn't work.&quot;)<br /> <br /> * - Despite the game being on, I don't have much vested interest in it, other than to hopefully see the Patriots lose miserably, so I'll actually be writing during it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Geography sure matters to me. The Old Norse stuff is important cultural history here. This is just second in importance to having a setting for modern northern Europe.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/385354-werewolf-the-forsaken-dark-era-the-bowery-dogs-and-more?p=388673#post388673\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">SOMEBODY GET ME A LINK TO THE VIKING WEREWOLF PAGE! I can't find it!<br /> <br /> *so much excited flailing!*<br /> <br /> Edit: Found it...ehehehehe. ^^;<br /> <br /> Seriously though, if we get Viking Werewolf, I may just start translating every kenning and god name I can find into First Tongue. Maybe even a blurb of fiction.</div> </div> </div> </div>If you do. I'm going to seriously find a way to deify you. Because that's god-levels of awesome.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-01T16:43:28-08:00","id":389109,"title":"","content":"It would just be really nice to see Werewolf in any sort of historical context. Everything we've gotten so far exists in terms of shards, a single scenario or a mythical place that exists out of sync with the rest of the world. Even the dark era places more emphasis on the history of New York than anything that happened to the Uratha. Since werewolves are supposed to have been around since, at least, humanity crossed the ice bridge. Surely something has happened in that time. Has a shartha host ever managed to reform into its progenitor being? Was there a 10th tribe? An 11th? A 25th? Or was being a werewolf the exact same now as it is was a hundred, a thousand, twenty thousand, a hundred thousand years ago, with Forsaken battling Pure in a deadlock and shartha still trying to reform and the Bale Hounds swearing that one day they will win?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custo