 is that if Werewolf doesn't get it now, they might pop up with another, better dark era. Of course, that's no reason to not vote, as it's just as possible the next Werewolf dark era to appear may be something no one's interested in. And that may be the only time it pops up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T17:51:56-08:00","id":390719,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/385354-werewolf-the-forsaken-dark-era-the-bowery-dogs-and-more?p=390236#post390236\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The way I see it is that if Werewolf doesn't get it now, they might pop up with another, better dark era. Of course, that's no reason to not vote, as it's just as possible the next Werewolf dark era to appear may be something no one's interested in. And that may be the only time it pops up.</div> </div> </div> </div>I hope this one gets a re-try. Because this is basically the era I've wanted to play since I started playing Werewolf...<br /> Sure, we have a family feud in War against the Pure, but that doesn't show ANYTHING about playing in that setting. It just gives us enough of a hint to hunger for some actual information.","signatu